# Topic-level permissions (least privilege)

# Simulator: publishes synthetic telemetry, records and ground truth; receives control commands
user simulator
topic write oilintelligence/simulation/#
topic write oilintelligence/events/transfers
topic write oilintelligence/events/records/#
topic write oilintelligence/events/runs
topic write oilintelligence/truth/#
topic read oilintelligence/simulation/control
topic write oilintelligence/simulation/replies/#

# Backend: reads telemetry, records and (simulation mode) truth; publishes anomalies / control
user backend
topic read oilintelligence/simulation/#
topic read oilintelligence/plant/#
topic read oilintelligence/events/#
topic read oilintelligence/truth/#
topic write oilintelligence/events/anomalies
topic write oilintelligence/events/faults
topic write oilintelligence/simulation/control
topic readwrite oilintelligence/simulation/replies/#
topic readwrite oilintelligence/system/#

# OPC UA bridge: read-only consumer of simulation telemetry
user opcua
topic read oilintelligence/simulation/#

# Plant gateway: may publish plant telemetry only (cannot see simulation truth)
user gateway
topic write oilintelligence/plant/#
